"""Approximate a short 'os' spelling detector with negative activation.

Short os/OS chunks and cos are strong; long -os words are weaker.
Case, punctuation, and Romance plural/verb suffixes adjust the magnitude.
A decaying count of recent Romance function words weakens short chunks;
it resets at document boundaries. Cyrillic ос, Arabic وس, accented ós,
related spellings, trigonometric names and OS names have additional rules.
Other tokens predict zero: fine token-specific effects are not modeled.
"""
READS = ()
ROMANCE_WORDS = frozenset(
    'de del la el los las que en una uno un uma para com não por dos das '
    'do da na no ao aos o os se são y e'.split()
)


