"""Layer-0 MLP component 3762: a negative detector for the word after a nationality or
place name.

It is negative on the word that follows a nationality adjective or place word that
opens a compound name: "American [football]", "European [Parliament]", "Canadian [...]",
"county [seat]", "local [governments]", "中国 [电视剧]". The strength depends on the
previous word (demonym strongest, then Chinese place words, then place names, then
